<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταψάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stroke, caress</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταψῶσα τοῦ παιδίου τὴν κεφαλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταψῶν αὐτὸν [τὸν κάνθαρον] ὥσπερ
					πωλίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					75
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φαλακρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					6.76
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.411
			</span></i>; <i>to be stroked the right way</i>, Sch.Gen.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.474
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>smooth down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.13.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.18.3
			</span></i>; <i>cajole, wheedle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1011.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>scrape down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς τοίχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).199
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				48
			</span></i>(Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <i>rub down</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅτερος τὸν ἕτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
